    "entry": "絵組",
    "reading": {
      "primary": "えぐみ",
      "alternatives": [],
      "is_heteronym": false
    },
    "grammar": {
      "pos": [
        "名詞"
      ],
      "ctype": null,
      "inflections": null
    },
    "definitions": [
      {
        "index": 1,
        "gloss": "structure of an artwork",
        "register": "standard",
        "nuance": null,
        "scenarios": [],
        "sensory_tags": {
          "colors": [],
          "temperature": null,
          "sounds": [],
          "emotions": []
        },
        "collocations": [],
        "examples": {
          "standard": [
            {
              "text": "この浮世絵は、大胆な構図と色彩の絵組が、見る者を惹きつける。",
              "citation": {
                "source": "Illusions AI",
                "author": "Gemini",
                "note": "gemini-2.5-flash-lite"
              }
            },
            {
              "text": "展示されている絵画は、ミニマルながらも計算された絵組が印象的だ。",
              "citation": {
                "source": "Illusions AI",
                "author": "Gemini",
                "note": "gemini-2.5-flash-lite"
              }
            },
            {
              "text": "彼女の作品は、奇抜なモチーフと安定した絵組のバランスが絶妙だ。",
              "citation": {
                "source": "Illusions AI",
                "author": "Gemini",
                "note": "gemini-2.5-flash-lite"
              }
            }
          ],
          "literary": [
            {
              "text": "どうして覚えてゐるのか知らんが、角か弁天座の竪看板に、我当の兄我童の、仁左衛門襲名の披露狂言大和橋の絵組みがあつて、此に向つて、片手をひろげ片手を地面について、驚いた恰好の馬方の袖に右団治――後、斎入――の紋の松かは菱に蔦の葉がついてゐた。",
              "citation": {
                "source": "春永話",
                "author": "折口信夫",
                "note": "青空文庫"
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "index": 2,
        "gloss": "pictures inserted in a book",
        "register": "standard",
        "nuance": null,
        "scenarios": [],
        "sensory_tags": {
          "colors": [],
          "temperature": null,
          "sounds": [],
          "emotions": []
        },
        "collocations": [],
        "examples": {
          "standard": [
            {
              "text": "昔の草双紙は、挿絵（絵組）が物語の雰囲気を一層豊かにしている。",
              "citation": {
                "source": "Illusions AI",
                "author": "Gemini",
                "note": "gemini-2.5-flash-lite"
              }
            },
            {
              "text": "この児童書は、文字よりも絵組が中心で、子供たちが想像を膨らませやすい。",
              "citation": {
                "source": "Illusions AI",
                "author": "Gemini",
                "note": "gemini-2.5-flash-lite"
              }
            },
            {
              "text": "博物館で見た古文書には、精緻な絵組とともに、当時の生活が描かれていた。",
              "citation": {
                "source": "Illusions AI",
                "author": "Gemini",
                "note": "gemini-2.5-flash-lite"
              }
            }
          ],
          "literary": []
        }
